ission Notice 2026-27\nProspectus 2026-27\nNoticeboard\nNo data available!\nAbout  The   College\nOne of the premier institutions of higher education in Biswanath district of Assam, Kalabari College has come a long way since its inception in 1992. Situated at an easily accessible location in Kalabari of Biswanath District along the National Highway 15, the college has been able to provide a sustainable momentum to the efforts to provide quality education to the student…\nContinue Reading...\nFrom The Principal's Desk\nDr. Pradip Sarmah\nPrincipal, Kalabari College\nAt the very outset, I on behalf of college family welcome you to this premier institution of higher education. It gives immense pleasure to welcome all the candidate who seek admission in to B.A. course in our college. The college was established in the year 1992 (affiliated to Gauhati University) to give an opprtunity to those who are deprives of high quality education mainly in our backward places. It has been maintaining high academic standard. It is a provincialized college and affiliated to Gauhati University and recognized by UGC, New Delhi. The college has very good infrastructure Administration building, Computer Laboratory, Educational…\nContinue Reading...\nOnline Resources for Students\nStudent  Zone\nProspectus 2025\nSyllabus\nHoliday List\nNotification Archive\nEvents\nFeedback\nCode of Ethics\nSatisfaction Survey\nE-Journal\nSeminars\nPhoto Gallery\nPress & Media\nAcademic Calendar\nClass Programme\nAnti Ragging Campus\nRight to Information\nNews  &  Events\nCollege Week Closing Ceremony cum Freshman Social\n2022-02-22\nRead More\nSwaccha Bharat Mission\n2022-01-08\nRead More\nAwareness Programme on Women's Sanitation, Nutrition & Health\n2021-12-21\nRead More\n📸   Photo  Gallery\nView More...\nQuick Links\nUGC\nNAAC\nDHE, Assam\nGovt. of India\nGovt. of Assam\nQuick Links\nGauhati University\nKKHSOU, Assam\nGU Portal\nGU IDOL\nNAD\nContact Us\n03715 291015\nkalabaricollege@gmail.com\nsarmapradip178@gmail.com\nKalabari, Biswanath, Assam - 784178\nMap Location\nCopyright © 2026 Kalabari College.  All rights reserved.\nDesigned & Developed by Dr. Lakhinandan Bora\n1\n0\n0\n2\n0\n2\nTotal Users : 100202", "links": [{"label": "Skip to content", "url": "https://kalabaricollege.org.in/#content"}, {"label": "Welcome to the Official Website of Kalabari College", "url": "https://kalabaricollege.org.in/"}, {"label": "Contact Us", "url": "https://kalabaricollege.org.in/contact-us/"}, {"label": "", "url": "https://kalabaricollege.org.in/"}, {"label": "কলাবাৰী মহাবিদ্যালয়", "url": "https://kalabaricollege.org.in/"}, {"label": "Kalabari College", "url": "https://kalabaricollege.org.in/"}, {"label": "Faculty  Login", "url": "https://onlineportal.kalabaricollege.org.in/login/"}, {"label": "Student  Login", "url": "https://onlineportal.kalabaricollege.org.in"}, {"label": "Home", "url": "https://kalabaricollege.org.in/"}, {"label": "About Us", "url": "https://kalabaricollege.org.in/"}, {"label": "About The College", "url": "https://kalabaricollege.org.in/about-the-college/"}, {"label": "Mission & Vision", "url": "https://kalabaricollege.org.in/mission-vision/"}, {"label": "Official Documents", "url": "https://kalabaricollege.org.in/official-documents/"}, {"label": "Memorandum of Understanding (MoU)", "url": "https://kalabaricollege.org.in/mou/"}, {"label": "Academic & Administrative Audit Report", "url": "https://kalabaricollege.org.in/academic-administrative-audit/"}, {"label": "External Financial Audit Report", "url": "https://kalabaricollege.org.in/financial-audit/"}, {"label": "Green Audit Report", "url": "https://kalabaricollege.org.in/green-audit/"}, {"label": "Administration", "url": "https://kalabaricollege.org.in/"}, {"label": "Principal", "url": "https://kalabaricollege.org.in/principal-2/"}, {"label": "Teaching Staff", "url": "https://kalabaricollege.org.in/teaching-staff/"}, {"label": "Non-Teaching Staff", "url": "https://kalabaricollege.org.in/non-teaching-